{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 169135, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 114899, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "索尔火WB正式攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1665673743, "updated_at": 1671610051, "updated_uid": 55158, "comment_at": 1666413880, "last_at": 1666484327, "comment_count": 76, "status": 1, "summary": "萌新可以看下这篇。建议看下这篇、这篇、这篇、这篇。一、阵容速览针对比较多的问题补充：1.WB水刀里，巴里的强度仅次于卡西亚。当然U伊芙、U菩萨啥的只要U了都能用。百分比刀在都不点火的情况下有压倒性战力", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 22, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 26865, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 4, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 169135, "content": "<div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;background:transparent;\">萌新可以看下<a href=\"http://dc.gamekee.com/22411.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-size:20px;background:transparent;color:blue;\">这篇</a></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;background:transparent;\">。</span><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">建议看下<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/86150.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>、<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/73498.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>、<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/57416.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>、<a href=\"https://dc.gamekee.com/48889.html\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\">这篇</a>。</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title4\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(0, 182, 79);\"><div class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">一、阵容速览</span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background: transparent;\"><span style=\"background:transparent;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">针对比较多的问题补充：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">1.WB水刀里，巴里的强度仅次于卡西亚。当然U伊芙、U菩萨啥的只要U了都能用。百分比刀在都不点火的情况下有压倒性战力，比如不点火卡西亚＞2红青钢影。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">2.拉姆满火+0~+1，或者拉姆不点火+0~+5，都可以带上U木伞，具体带U木伞的拉姆加值界限有待考察。不点火木伞任何情况下都不用带。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">3.U羊妹＞比利，但是注意了，+6羊妹不点火概率85.2%，还是木属性被克制，敢用就敢空，点火后直接97.2%，稳稳的拿下。羊妹没点火还低加老老实实比利。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">4.各种原因导致下掉一个人（比如要上U木伞），人选如下：队伍附魔情况优秀的情况下可以下鲁茵，否则可能时停不住；光琴没点火可以下光琴，+0满火光琴就有一定价值，想下也不是不行；最没用的是米莉雅，但人家是加成，为了打伤害放弃加成属于本末倒置，你要不在意可以下；里欧属于最后的选择，不点火且低加里欧可以下。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">这期防御力多少还没摸清，反正不影响阵容，影响的是队长选择。</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background: transparent;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; background: transparent; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background:transparent;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">基础</span><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\">队伍：</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; background: transparent; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;\"><br style=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189900654_19062620.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1594189900654_19062620.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"78\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);width:69px;height:69px;font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/12/575831.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/2/30/553788.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624954556998_38542203.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1624954556998_38542203.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_300\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"62\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1595404228745_73089316.jpg?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"109\" data-height=\"115\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1606964735946_76367541.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1615707961063_84256006.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1615707961063_84256006.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"70\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618873746_90246811.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618873746_90246811.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"66\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);width:69px;height:69px;font-size:13.9999px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605681463321_69639550.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1605681463321_69639550.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"67\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);width:69px;height:69px;font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1641977132754_65479703.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1641977132754_65479703.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"71\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161681871_88958026.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161681871_88958026.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"72\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617711219_50134595.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_128/h_128/202/57/2022/8/14/913594.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1612855166919_44189771.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1612855166919_44189771.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"77\" style=\"width:69px;height:69px;font-size:0.37333rem;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618051145_9852355.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"127\" data-height=\"125\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618051145_9852355.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"63\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618127976_61907047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622617495455_1966492.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1622617495455_1966492.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"68\" style=\"font-size:0.37333rem;width:69px;height:69px;color:rgb(64,64,64);\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618907939_56501921.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"90\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618907939_56501921.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" class=\"img-view-ele\" img-count=\"69\" style=\"font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_250/h_250/202/57/2022/9/12/154529.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596618851406_7754732.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"90\" data-height=\"89\" style=\"font-size:13.9999px;width:69px;height:69px;\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size: 13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div></span></span></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.这期如果不是U了三把水刀，强烈建议只带两把刀。</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"\">2.如果整不明白站位的话可以<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">直接抄</span>，细节比较多，不解释了。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">注意先练一下拉姆（对策）</span>。这期队伍里没有混子，战斗力拉满。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">3.对于掏不出时停组合的玩家，一般是新手玩家，将时停姐妹（前排左3、左5）换成保命天子。以下内容针对非时停组合玩家。boss的dot配合切断很离谱，而且带基础命中率100%长达16s的硬控，梦回明王RB了属于是，不时停打，难度相当高。不时停打还是暗妲比+奶的老一套来应对。</div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">4.木属性中木莫娜（后排右1）攻击力最低；光属性中米莉雅（后排右2）和糖猫（后排右3）攻击力倒数2位；队伍整体攻击力倒数3位为:3红以上米莉雅则，米莉雅、拉姆、水旗袍（前排右4）/U水妲比（优先），否则<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">拉姆、水旗袍、比利（前排左5）/U水妲比（优先）</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></div></span><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div></span></span><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"\"></span><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">5.比利也可以换姬瓦，相应做点调整。羊妹被boss克制，降低减益命中率，没点火的话不推荐，点火了随意</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">。</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><br></div></span></div></span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><div style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">进阶队伍：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">很简单，鲁茵换第三把水刀，建议有6套捣蛋鬼+减益命中附魔，且3把U水刀。</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">个人情况6张捣蛋鬼平均+3，6个减益命中附魔平均+16%，去掉鲁茵后，战斗结束时boss没放出ds但是ds条为70%。</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">此时全队攻击力倒数3位：木人鱼、拉姆、白仆猫</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">技能预约：</span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></div><div style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><div style=\"\"><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"\"><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\"></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\">鲁邦、光琴、里欧、木莫娜：</span>STTTT；</div><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">白仆猫</span>、米莉雅：3红STTTT，否则S；</div></span><span style=\"\"><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">卡西亚（后排左1）：TSSSS；</div><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\">其余：S。</span></div></span></span><span style=\"\"><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></div></span><div style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"></div></div></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><div style=\"font-size:13.9999px;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><div style=\"\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br style=\"\"></div></div></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;font-size:13.9999px;\"></div></div></span></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background: transparent; font-weight: bold;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 13.9999px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background: transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><span style=\"background:transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">队长技：</span></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;background:rgb(255,255,255);\">暂定为拉姆。</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:16px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-weight:bold;background:rgb(255,255,255);\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">DS顺序：</span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight:bold;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;\">基础队伍：水旗袍——水罗汉/白仆猫——水狙</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;\"><br style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"background:transparent;\">进阶队伍：<span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:16px;\">水旗袍——白仆猫——水狙</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight:bold;color:rgb(64,64,64);background:transparent;\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;color:rgb(64,64,64);background:transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><br style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:20px;\">魂卡：</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">1.妨碍首选“捣蛋鬼莫娜”，光击剑、</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">比利、姬瓦</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;\">也可以用“米利安的回忆”</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">2.前排辅助首选“表演的时刻到了”或“超活力斗士”（水属性限定）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background: transparent;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;background:transparent;\">3.前排没有合适魂卡就白板血防或者带血量的魂卡；</span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background: transparent;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;\">4.水刀首选“温暖的休息时间”，而“鲁萨尔卡得不到回报”稍微差点，没有就白板攻暴。</span><br></div></div></div><div><br></div><br>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 194, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 99017156, "content_num": 1065, "read_num": 2013197, "like_num": 1043}, "update_user": {"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 194, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "last_ip_area": "上海", "last_login_device_num": 1}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/